Orilon was a city in [[Geography/Færrin/Raelion/index|Raelion]], set on a river that ran through its middle and carried trading boats both ways. Its newer outskirts were poured concrete housing, thrown up fast, and its sewer system was lived in and poorly kept, with dwellers down in the muck who fished coins and goods out of the water. Guards patrolled the roads into the city in cars on a regular circuit.

Orilon held one of Raelion's fanes, an ossuary set just off the river and run by the country's central authority. The [[Phenomena/Hearts|Heart]] [[Geography/Færrin/Raelion/Orilon/Bones Have Eyes|Bones Have Eyes]] manifested it. The city was unmade with the rest of [[Geography/Færrin/Raelion/index|Raelion]] on the Night of the [[Phenomena/Midnight Sun|Midnight Sun]].
